                            {
                                "target_word": "Nordic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50e8399b-afff-3454-a4c4-8366fa03bfde",
                                        "entry_id": "4b78bb85-8bda-395c-a572-fc274af561c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of Nordic descent or having features typical of Nordic people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33557400-7a69-34b2-b7de-d2d4d0b96815",
                                        "entry_id": "4b78bb85-8bda-395c-a572-fc274af561c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A race of extraterrestrials similar in appearance to Nordic humans."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863a341c-012d-4ec9-aced-77da27a93d45",
                                                "sense_id": "33557400-7a69-34b2-b7de-d2d4d0b96815",
                                                "text": "Called “Nordics,” the aliens are human-like in appearance, of average height, and often have long, flowing hair. Contactees are typically struck by the beauty of the Nordics, as was Howard Menger (1959): “She seemed to radiate and glow,” Menger explains,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38d484f1-27b5-4c20-845d-765d78e07917",
                                                "sense_id": "33557400-7a69-34b2-b7de-d2d4d0b96815",
                                                "text": "But the third most common alien is called a Nordic, or humanoid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f017bd82-961b-4969-bbd8-02757d98d914",
                                                "sense_id": "33557400-7a69-34b2-b7de-d2d4d0b96815",
                                                "text": "Known as Nordics, these extraterrestrials are said to have blond hair, blue eyes, and pale skin and are anywhere from 6 to 8 feet (183cm to 244cm) tall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b1b0951-3a85-4658-9aee-896786bbb4a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "6323ef2f-3724-3d1d-914c-3672098e4ac5",
